    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n8 hours ago The following is a listing of all residential property transfers in East Brunswick reported during the week of April 13. There were 12 transactions posted during this time. During this period, the median sale for the area was a 1,852-square-foot property on Hamlin Road in East Brunswick that sold for $670,000. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
